'''Alolan Vulpix''' (Japanese: '''アローラロコン''' ''Alolan Rokon'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

