==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Vulpix}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Alolan Vulpix|21}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
*'''Call Forth Cold''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Kyurem|50}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

